X:3
T: Dusty Miller
P: Longways for as many as will
R: minuet
B: "Caledonian Country Dances" printed by John Walsh for John Johnson, London
S: 1: http://imslp.org/wiki/Caledonian_Country_Dances_with_a_Thorough_Bass_(Various) p.16
