X:6
T: The Gaveson
R: minuet
B: John Walsh "Caledonian Country Dances"
S: 2: http://petrucci.mus.auth.gr/imglnks/usimg/5/50/IMSLP98359-PMLP202128-walsh_caledonian_country_dance_vol2.1.pdf p.9 #269
