% - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
%%begintext align
Lead down between the 2d Cu. and without sides the 3d Cu. and turn your Partner .|
Lead up to the top foot and cast off :|
Hands round with the 3d Cu. .|
Right hand and left with the 2d Cu. :|:
%%endtext

